WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:05.240
Satoshi, who aims to battle
the Supreme Monarch, Dande...

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:10.240
And Go, who dreams of catching every Pokémon
to work his way up to Mew...

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:15.580
This is the story of
their lives and adventures.

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:22.460
Aww...

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:25.300
I was so close to catching it...

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:26.670
You’ll get more chances.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.170
Great timing.

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:29.680
You have a call waiting, Satoshi.

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.140
It’s Arabesque Town’s Gym Leader.

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:32.640
Huh?

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:35.640
It’s been a while, hasn’t it?

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:37.560
Oh, the quiz lady!

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.440
She was a Gym Leader...?

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:48.240
Yes. My name is Poplar.
I’m inviting you two to a special tournament.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:49.610
A tournament?

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:50.860
Huh? Me, too?

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:55.080
I hear Dande’s taken
quite a liking to you two.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:57.700
That’s why I chose to invite you.

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.460
Is Mr. Dande gonna be there, too?!

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:00.620
Naturally.

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:02.250
I’ll do it!

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:06.340
I guess I could catch some
Galar Pokémon while I’m there...

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:07.590
I’ll go too!

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:11.010
Good. Okay, I’ll be waiting!

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:14.390
I might get to battle Mr. Dande!

00:01:15.390 --> 00:01:18.350
Chances like these
don’t come along too often.

00:01:18.350 --> 00:01:19.520
Go and do your best.

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:19.980
Sure!

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:21.020
I’m coming too!

00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:37.240
There, there.

00:01:37.870 --> 00:01:38.870
I know, I know.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:45.670
I’d love to spend more time with you,
but I need to get going. See ya!

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:49.630
By the way...

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:51.800
Which way is Arabesque Town?

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:02.810
Hey, you still not ready? C'mon, hurry up!

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:05.610
You all packed and ready to leave?

00:02:05.610 --> 00:02:08.110
I'll show you this wide mysterious world

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:10.990
And skip the slow send-off

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:13.490
Be it through fire or through water

00:02:13.490 --> 00:02:16.120
I'm fumbling blindly through the days

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:21.040
When I don't even know what the next second will bring

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:26.040
Each and every one of my memories

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:30.550
Can always be found inside a Ball

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:33.970
On 1, 2, 3, dive in!

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:40.470
I've got my plans for when I grow up in my pocket

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:46.690
Greeting someone new is always fresh

00:02:46.690 --> 00:02:50.940
No need (No need!) to hesitate! Try! (Try!)

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:52.280
Let's have a fight!

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:54.700
1. Once the battle's done

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:56.820
2. And we're laughing or crying

00:02:56.820 --> 00:03:01.580
On 3, let's be friends!

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:07.670
Any day and every day, that's always been my rule

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:12.920
With this unpredictable, unfathomable world awaiting

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:15.340
Let's go! Every time you trip and fall

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:19.510
Let's go! You pick yourself up by my side

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:22.270
I choose you!

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:31.270
Mawhip's Sweet Battle?!

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:32.280
Arabesque Town, Galar Region

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:36.240
Satoshi, Go, and Koharu have arrived
in Arabesque Town, in Galar.

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:40.910
It looks like they’ve taken a little detour
on the way to the tournament.

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:47.040
It tastes great!

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:50.960
The rumors were true.
The pâtissier here makes amazing cakes!

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.460
Right, Eevee?

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:55.260
So this is why you tagged along.

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:56.170
Can you blame me?

00:03:56.170 --> 00:04:01.180
I really regretted not coming here
last time we were in town!

00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:04.560
Thanks for telling us
about this place, Koharu!

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:11.440
It’s like it tastes of happiness.

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:13.520
The cream is what’s really special.

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:18.280
Look, that’s the pâtissier and
his partner Mawhip over there.

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:22.660
The flavor of Mawhip’s cream changes
depending on how well she gets along with her trainer.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:24.040
Huh...

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:29.170
Mawhip! Cream Pokémon!
Fairy type!

00:04:29.170 --> 00:04:34.800
When Mawhip is content, the cream it secretes
from its hands becomes sweeter and richer!

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:40.430
The pâtissier and Mawhip here
must be really close partners, then!

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:44.970
These are amazing dipped in cream!

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:47.930
Huh?

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:52.980
Oh, is that a Pokémon? It’s cute!

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:56.530
Think it came in here
hoping for some cake?

00:04:57.900 --> 00:04:59.320
Who’s that Pokémon?

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:03.240
Mahomil! Cream Pokémon!
Fairy type!

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:05.410
Its body is made of cream!

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:08.910
It was born from
sweet-smelling particles in the air!

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:14.170
Whoa, what’s that for?

00:05:14.170 --> 00:05:15.880
Do you want me to catch you?

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:20.840
Okay... Monster Ball, go!

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:26.680
Mahomil’s data will be
added to the Index!

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:28.810
I caught a Mahomil!

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:31.640
Nice to meet you, Mahomil!

00:05:32.190 --> 00:05:33.690
Good for you, Go!

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.030
Ahh, Sarunori!

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:44.410
Eevee, stop!

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:45.240
Stop it!

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.280
Hey!

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:52.080
Do you want some cake?

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:54.630
Here.

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:58.630
Do you want something bigger?

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:02.800
Maybe it wants the
decorative candy atop the cake?

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:03.550
Huh?

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.140
This?

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:10.390
Looks like you were right!

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:15.690
I didn’t think you’d be
<i>that</i> happy, Mahomil!

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:18.730
I’m happy I made a new friend, too!

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:20.480
You’ll end up tripping...

00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:25.740
Huh?

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:26.870
Is that...?

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:28.280
Already?!

00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:39.130
Mawhip’s data will be
added to the Index!

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.460
What a surprise!

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:46.510
Mahomil evolve if you spin them around,
just like whisking whipped cream.

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:50.770
She must’ve been very happy
that you gave her that decorative candy.

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:55.520
I’m sure you’ll make great partners.

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:57.770
I get it...

00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:00.270
Nice to meet you again, Mawhip!

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:06.990
Hello!

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.410
Oh, you’re here.

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:12.500
What kind of tournament
are you doing today?

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:14.660
The whole way here
I’ve been really excited!

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:17.170
Is Mr. Dande here yet?

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:20.340
Just settle down.
Come this way.

00:07:22.590 --> 00:07:23.590
Oh, right.

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:28.260
The Gallop and Ponyta
you met in the forest are doing fine.

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:30.390
Really?

00:07:32.850 --> 00:07:34.350
Gallop!

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:41.940
I’ve been wondering how they were.

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:43.530
That’s great to hear!

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:46.610
Mr. Dande!

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:49.490
Huh?

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:52.990
It’s Mr. Kibana...

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:57.370
If Mr. Kibana of the Masters Eight is here too,
this must be a huge tournament...

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:03.500
Oh... Weren’t you...?

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:10.550
I’ll beat Mr. Dande and become
the strongest Pokémon Trainer!

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:13.430
You’re that energetic kid
from back then!

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:14.270
What’s your name?

00:08:14.270 --> 00:08:17.980
I’m Satoshi!
This is my partner, Pikachu.

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:22.440
I see. So you’re the Satoshi
that Dande’s been talking about.

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:23.610
Yeah!

00:08:23.610 --> 00:08:25.070
But...

00:08:25.070 --> 00:08:27.110
Dande himself isn’t here...

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:28.350
Did he make a run for it...?

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:30.910
Mr. Dande wouldn’t run away!

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:32.580
He’d never run from a battle!

00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:37.580
Huh? I’d be running too,
if only I <i>could.</i>

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:42.330
You’re not getting away.

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:46.840
I know full well that if I ran
I’d just be asking for trouble.

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:51.090
I’ve never been able to
disobey this old hag. Or rather...

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:53.800
Maybe we should be getting back...

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:54.970
Right...

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:58.350
You’ll also be competing,
of course.

00:08:58.350 --> 00:08:59.190
Huh?!

00:08:59.190 --> 00:09:00.940
Us, too?!

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:05.860
You even have the perfect Pokémon.

00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:08.110
Sorry, I ended up being late.

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:10.280
You took your time, Dande...

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:12.620
Oh, you’re here too, Satoshi?

00:09:12.620 --> 00:09:15.490
Mr. Dande,
I’ve been looking forward to seeing you!

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:17.870
I really wanted to battle you!

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:20.330
Well, that’s up to
Ms. Poplar, I guess...

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:21.250
Huh?

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:26.380
So, what sort of game
have you got for us today, Ms. Poplar?

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:30.880
All of you had better
prepare yourselves.

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:36.600
Hosted by Poplar, loved by everyone!

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:42.230
The first Mawhip Everywhere
Decor Tournament starts now!

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:45.480
What’s that mean?!

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:48.400
Pocket Monsters!

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:01.620
What’s a Decor Tournament?

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:02.830
Some sort of battle?

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:04.130
Umm...

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:11.630
You’ll each team up with
one of these Mawhip and decorate cakes.

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:13.800
Look at all the Mawhip!

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:16.180
There’s so many different ones!

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:18.220
They’re colorful!

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:20.770
Their decorative candies
are all different, too.

00:10:20.770 --> 00:10:25.480
A Mawhip’s trainer
affects the taste of her cream.

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:29.440
What does the cream of
a strong trainer taste like?

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:31.360
What about a kind trainer?

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:33.280
Or an excited trainer?

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:37.160
Doesn’t it make you want to
taste them all...?

00:10:37.160 --> 00:10:39.370
More nonsense...

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:43.040
Ms. Poplar holds tournaments
at the drop of a hat

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:47.670
Sometimes they involve battles...
But not today, I guess.

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:50.710
I really wanted to battle Mr. Dande...

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:54.630
Always give it your all!

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:56.260
Whoever has the most fun wins!

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:57.930
Mr. Dande...

00:10:57.930 --> 00:10:58.510
Yeah!

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:00.680
It looks kinda fun!

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:03.430
I’ve never made a cake before.

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:04.350
Have you?

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:06.480
With my mom, at least.

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:10.940
Now, each of you should
pick your Mawhip partner.

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:14.030
I’ll use my own Mawhip, of course.

00:11:14.030 --> 00:11:15.030
I’m counting on you!

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:18.030
Uh...

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:21.990
Oh, would you mind
being my partner?

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:27.710
Think you can work with me
and give it all you’ve got?

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:33.460
What’s this?

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:35.670
You’re running away?

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:37.590
When Dande’s so eager?

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:40.350
Wh-Who’d try and run?

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:42.810
I’ll never say no to a challenge,
and I’ll never lose!

00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:47.940
Now, you stand out.
You’re perfect for me!

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:51.230
What do you think?
Great photo, huh?

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:54.650
Hmm...

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:57.570
They’ve got a great sweet scent!

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:00.910
This one smells the best!

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:04.160
She’s a Caramel Mix.

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:05.040
That settles it!

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:07.500
Mawhip,
please be my partner!

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:12.340
Okay, looks like everyone’s
made their choice.

00:12:12.340 --> 00:12:14.840
Now then... To your positions!

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:17.800
And... Start!

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:19.050
Here goes!

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:20.300
Let’s do it!

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:29.560
Pour a generous amount of
whipped cream over the sponge!

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:33.980
Use a palette knife
to flatten and spread it!

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:39.280
Rotate the turntable to cover
the sides with cream as well!

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:41.950
Looks like the start is
the most important...

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:45.450
Thanks, Mawhip!

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:52.250
Give us some
super tasty cream, Mawhip!

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:54.460
Wow!

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:57.340
Now, I just need to cover it in this...

00:12:57.340 --> 00:12:58.800
Okay!

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:01.840
Huh?

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:09.600
My mom taught me that when the cream’s too runny,
you should whisk it while cooling it with ice.

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:12.600
Makes sense...
Thanks, Koharu!

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:15.480
Okay, Sarunori!
Hold the bowl for me!

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:20.240
Now this is fun.

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:23.450
I’m gonna make the
world’s tastiest cake!

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:25.240
Go wild, my partner!

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:31.250
This cream’s really good!

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:32.750
It smells great, too!

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:35.590
All right! It’s covered!

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:36.750
Go for it, Pikachu!

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:43.680
And turn!

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:46.600
That’s it! Eevee, you’ve got it!

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:52.480
Hey, Sarunori!
Stop snacking on the cream!

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:05.200
That was really helpful, Mawhip.
Thanks!

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:10.000
Oh, Sarunori!

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:10.950
Some of these...

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:13.500
And I’ll add some of these too!

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:16.210
So? Makes for a pretty picture,
doesn’t it?

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:19.460
That was a lot of fun.

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:22.630
How about this?

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:25.340
I based it on Mawhip.

00:14:26.390 --> 00:14:27.720
It looks tasty!

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:29.260
Now that’s pretty good!

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:31.890
Really? How’s yours?

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:36.110
Well...
Sarunori licked off all the cream...

00:14:37.400 --> 00:14:40.650
Look at my cake, too!
Ta-daaah!

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:43.740
Hmm... It’s very... unique.

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:45.410
That doesn’t look tasty.

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:48.410
Okay, looks like everyone’s done.

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:50.700
Let’s try it.

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:58.040
It has a strong sweetness
with quite the kick.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:00.920
But it has a rich flavor,
and a fragrant aroma.

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:05.220
The taste I would expect
from the champion’s personality.

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:07.670
I’m glad you like it.

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:17.860
A flashy appearance,
and complex flavors beneath.

00:15:17.860 --> 00:15:20.320
At first glance, the gaudiness
may give you pause,

00:15:20.320 --> 00:15:24.190
but it’s a reliable, unquestionable
top-class cake underneath.

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:25.610
Didn’t I tell you?

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:27.740
I’ll never say no to a challenge,
and I’ll never lose!

00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:31.660
My Pokémon ate it all...

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:34.250
If your friend is content
with the cream already,

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:38.040
it shows you and Mawhip
will get on well together.

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:38.880
Right!

00:15:43.590 --> 00:15:49.090
You have a kind heart
that truly values Pokémon, don’t you?

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:51.430
I can tell just from the taste.

00:15:51.850 --> 00:15:54.680
I see why Ponyta and Gallop liked you.

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:56.850
Thank you!

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:01.150
Now, the last cake...

00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:04.280
Well, this is quite creative...

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:07.030
Mawhip made tasty cream for me!

00:16:07.030 --> 00:16:11.030
So I wanted to
make the cake real tasty!

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:16.370
There’s a thrill to
a taste which you can’t even predict...

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:25.170
And a mysterious taste
that makes you hungry for more!

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:27.720
How intriguing!

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:30.050
Does that mean it’s tasty?

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:31.970
Now I want to try it, too...

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:36.930
I know! I’ll battle you!

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:37.680
Battle?

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:40.520
Wait, what’s going on now?!

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:43.770
You’re the trainer behind this cream.

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:46.740
I bet your battles are also intriguing.

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:47.820
Just like that?

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:50.160
I’m the host of the tournament.

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:51.570
I am the rules!

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:54.330
Hurry up, everyone!
Get to your positions!

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:55.200
Right!

00:16:55.200 --> 00:17:00.250
Well, I should know to expect
her crazy ideas by now, but still...

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:04.840
Satoshi’s bound to give her
an intriguing battle, though.

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:09.260
Go for it, Satoshi!

00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:10.340
Go for it!

00:17:14.350 --> 00:17:16.970
I’ll be the judge, then.

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:18.980
Both sides, send out your Pokémon.

00:17:18.980 --> 00:17:21.350
Pikachu, I choose you!

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:25.110
Come on out, Mawhip!

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:30.150
Yet another Mawhip color...

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:33.320
Battle, start!

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:35.080
Pikachu! Lightning Speed!

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.240
Iron Tail!

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:45.290
Keep up the Iron Tail!

00:17:49.550 --> 00:17:51.880
That Pikachu’s pretty fast.

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:53.840
But...

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:55.970
Okay! Great work, Pikachu!

00:17:56.600 --> 00:18:00.230
My, my, you certainly are hasty.

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:05.730
It didn’t work?!

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:09.230
Take a good look
at your own Pokémon.

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:16.070
I get it! The Iron Tail got weaker
because of all the cream stuck to it!

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:18.490
I never knew you
could use it like that...

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:21.620
Now then, why don’t we get started?

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:23.000
Attract!

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.130
Magical Shine!

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:38.390
Pikachu!

00:18:38.390 --> 00:18:39.380
Is it over?

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:45.600
Can you keep going, Pikachu?

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:49.360
Magical Shine!

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:52.650
Electroweb!

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:58.580
All right!

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:03.960
My, you’re not half bad.

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:10.420
Are you prepared?
I’m going to have some fun with this.

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:15.340
There!

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:28.770
Kyodaimax Mawhip!

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:31.230
Kyodai Finale!

00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:39.120
Pikachu!

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:40.990
That’s it for him.

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:42.950
You okay, Pikachu?!

00:19:57.010 --> 00:19:59.850
Pikachu Kyodaimaxed, too?!

00:19:59.850 --> 00:20:02.850
Hmm...
Now this is getting interesting.

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:10.360
Now <i>that’s</i> a surprise!

00:20:16.030 --> 00:20:18.740
Pikachu!
Kyodai Heavy Thunder!

00:20:22.120 --> 00:20:23.240
Pikachu?

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:24.740
What’s going on?

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:27.000
That’s no Kyodaimax.

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:30.830
He just ate the cream
and grew fatter...

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:34.670
He’s Bloatmaxed!

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:36.260
Whaaat?!

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:39.890
My, my, looks like it’s over.

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:57.070
Won’t make for a nice photo,
but how’s the taste...?

00:20:58.400 --> 00:20:59.570
This is...!

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:04.120
Satoshi’s cake...

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:05.410
It tastes great!

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:07.040
Yeah, that’s true!

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:14.420
They each taste different,
but each one is tasty.

00:21:14.420 --> 00:21:17.090
I’m glad I held this tournament.

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:20.470
Now then, when should I
schedule the second one...?

00:21:20.470 --> 00:21:21.510
Huh?

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:22.720
Mr. Dande!

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:27.970
I’m gonna win my way up
through the Championships so I can battle you!

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:30.480
I’m looking forward to it.

00:21:30.480 --> 00:21:31.690
Yeah!

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:35.440
Go has caught a Mawhip.

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:38.860
Satoshi has once again
resolved to battle Dande.

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:41.950
Their adventure together
continues.

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:55.420
Super Effective Type

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:58.550
Water is super effective on Ground!

00:21:58.550 --> 00:22:01.130
Soak them and watch them dissolve!

00:22:01.130 --> 00:22:03.970
Ground is super effective on Electric!

00:22:03.970 --> 00:22:06.390
They don’t even feel a shock!

00:22:06.390 --> 00:22:09.430
Electric is super effective on Flying!

00:22:09.430 --> 00:22:12.190
Hear the thunder rumble through the sky!

00:22:12.190 --> 00:22:14.860
Flying is super effective on Bug!

00:22:14.860 --> 00:22:17.400
They’re easy marks when flying high above!

00:22:17.400 --> 00:22:20.150
Learn how the 18 types interact

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:22.570
Now then, everyone, think about this!

00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:25.780
Swiftly swimming: the Water type!

00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:28.490
Pulsing with electricity: the Electric type!

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:31.120
Which type is super effective?!

00:22:32.540 --> 00:22:33.830
Electric!

